1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:14,940
Ask screen par aap apni pharmacy ke baare mein
seedhi bhaasha mein sawaal poochh sakte hain.

2
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:19,204
Jawaab isi counter ke apne data se, built-in
rules se aate hain,

3
00:00:19,244 --> 00:00:21,802
aur internet na ho tab bhi chalte hain.

4
00:00:22,557 --> 00:00:26,779
English mein poochhte hain: What are today's
total sales?

5
00:00:26,819 --> 00:00:31,638
Jawaab mein aaj ki kul bikri, bills ki ginti,
aur cash, UPI, card

6
00:00:31,678 --> 00:00:37,694
aur credit ka hissa aata hai, saath mein yeh bhi
ki aankde kis data se liye gaye.

7
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:41,004
Ab: Which medicines are running low?

8
00:00:41,044 --> 00:00:47,214
Is version ke built-in rules ne yeh phrasing
nahi samjhi, aur madad wala message diya.

9
00:00:47,254 --> 00:00:51,042
Aise mein neeche diye 'Low stock' button ko
dabaaiye.

10
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:54,031
Which batches are expiring soon?

11
00:00:54,071 --> 00:00:59,000
Yeh sawaal bhi galat samjha gaya, ise medicine
ka naam maan liya gaya.

12
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:02,762
'What expires in 30 days?' button sahi list deta
hai.

13
00:01:02,802 --> 00:01:08,369
Yeh kamiyaan humne QA report mein darj ki hain
aur code mein theek kar di hain.

14
00:01:09,146 --> 00:01:12,611
Ab Hindi mein: Aaj ki total sale kitni hai?

15
00:01:12,651 --> 00:01:14,322
Yeh sahi samjha gaya.

16
00:01:16,126 --> 00:01:18,391
Kaunsi medicines ka stock kam hai?

17
00:01:18,431 --> 00:01:25,239
Yahan bhi is version mein madad wala message
aata hai; 'Low stock' button se wahi jaankari
milti hai.

18
00:01:25,982 --> 00:01:29,584
Hinglish mein: Is month ka total profit kitna
hua?

19
00:01:29,624 --> 00:01:37,159
Counter ka assistant abhi munaafa nahi batata;
munaafa 'Reports & GST' mein Gross profit mein
milta hai.

20
00:01:37,199 --> 00:01:40,946
Par is month ki sale poochhein, to jawaab milta
hai.

21
00:01:41,727 --> 00:01:44,715
Aur: Kaun se medicines reorder karne hain?

22
00:01:44,755 --> 00:01:49,401
Reorder shabd se assistant reorder level se
neeche wali medicines

23
00:01:49,441 --> 00:01:51,924
aur sujhaai gayi maatra batata hai.

24
00:01:51,964 --> 00:01:55,529
Kisi bhi faisle se pehle aankde khud check
kijiye.

25
00:01:56,270 --> 00:02:06,592
Purchase order banaane ke liye Insights screen
par reorder ki salaah ko Order list mein jodiye;
list aap khud review karke supplier ko bhejte hain.

26
00:02:06,632 --> 00:02:09,200
Upar 'Ask AI' wala assistant bhi hai.

27
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:14,840
Dhyan rahe: Medoro ka AI doctor nahi hai, yeh
dava ya ilaaj ki salaah nahi deta.
